        ("Identify the CORRECT article usage:", ["She has the experience necessary for the position.","She has an experience necessary for the position.","She has experience necessary for the position.","Both A and C are correct depending on context."], "Both A and C are correct depending on context.", "'The experience' = specific experience being discussed. 'Experience' (no article) = general quality/background. Both can be correct.", ["context-dependent","countable vs uncountable"]),
