        ("Choose the correct article usage: 'In ___ light of ___ foregoing, ___ complaint is hereby dismissed.'", ["the ... the ... the","a ... the ... the","the ... a ... the","the ... the ... a"], "the ... the ... the", "All specific in legal context: 'the light of' (fixed expression); 'the foregoing' (what was discussed); 'the complaint' (specific).", ["legal formula","the","fixed expression"]),
        ("Choose the correct sentence:", ["He holds a rank of Director III in the civil service.","He holds the rank of Director III in the civil service.","He holds rank of Director III in the civil service.","He holds the rank of the Director III in civil service."], "He holds the rank of Director III in the civil service.", "'The rank' (specific rank); 'Director III' (title, no article); 'the civil service' (specific institution).", ["the","title","specific"]),
