        ("Choose the correct conjunction: I waited ___ she arrived.", ["unless","until","because","although"], "until", "'Until' indicates waiting up to the point of her arrival.", ["subordinating","time"]),
        ("Choose the correct conjunction: ___ the bell rang, the students rushed out.", ["Until","Unless","As soon as","Although"], "As soon as", "'As soon as' means immediately when.", ["subordinating","time"]),
        ("Choose the correct conjunction: He speaks ___ he were the boss.", ["because","as if","unless","until"], "as if", "'As if' introduces a comparison to something unreal.", ["subordinating","manner"]),
