        ("Choose the correct conjunction: ___ you study or not, the exam will proceed.", ["If","Whether","Unless","Although"], "Whether", "'Whether...or not' means regardless of the condition.", ["subordinating","regardless"]),
        ("Choose the correct conjunction: He is smart; ___, he is lazy.", ["therefore","however","moreover","furthermore"], "however", "'However' shows contrast (conjunctive adverb).", ["conjunctive adverb","contrast"]),
